{"text": "We have walked this road for fifteen years. The first ten? Slow. Very slow. So slow. Change in schools takes time. Then the network started to grow by itself. Today: almost three hundred institutions on one standard, with at least one client in eighty-five percent of Lithuania's municipalities. You don't have to start from the slow part. Audits, onboarding and training are ready. And an elephant never forgets: when staff change, the knowledge stays. The goal was never the websites. It is giving teachers back to their students. Built in a small country. Ready for yours. Across the European Union, public institutions share the same rules: web accessibility, data protection, whistleblower protection. Built for one, ready for all. Let's talk about your region.\n\nThank you for watching.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "e", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "r", "o", "a", "d", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "f", "i", "f", "t", "e", "e", "n", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", " ", "t", "e", "n", "?", " ", "S", "l", "o", "w", ".", " ", "V", "e", "r", "y", " ", "s", "l", "o", "w", ".", " ", "S", "o", " ", "s", "l", "o", "w", ".", " ", "C", "h", "a", "n", "g", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "s", "c", "h", "o", "o", "l", "s", " ", "t", "a", "k", "e", "s", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "e", "t", "w", "o", "r", "k", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", "t", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "g", "r", "o", "w", " ", "b", "y", " ", "i", "t", "s", "e", "l", "f", ".", " ", "T", "o", "d", "a", "y", ":", " ", "a", "l", "m", "o", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "r", "e", "e", " ", "h", "u", "n", "d", "r", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", "s", "t", "i", "t", "u", "t", "i", "o", "n", "s", " ", "o", "n", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "s", "t", "a", "n", "d", "a", "r", "d", ",", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", "t", " ", "l", "e", "a", "s", "t", " ", "o", "n", 